        "created_at": "2016-01-19T02:34:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>I am a long time player and lurker of the forums. Recently my friends and I decided to put together a story mode of sorts for the game and tried to outline major story archs and moments and recreating them through the available heros, villains and environments. We have a prototype story line and story mode assembled in an excel sheet in the link below (opens and looks best in Excel). The document reaches about as far as Shattered timeline events.&nbsp;</p><p>I am looking for feedback, ideas and suggested battles or events that belong in the timeline. I know some of you are real savants of the narrative that we have been able to piece together thus far. All feedback is welcome and thanks in advance!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>https://www.dropbox.com/s/ywb21w07hr2wgtz/The%20Multiverse%20Timeline.xlsx?dl=0</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:09.221Z",
