        "created_at": "2016-01-19T15:56:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>It looks super cool! I like this, gives me a purpose to go play more games, and not just random all the time.</span></p><p><span>I don't have any feedback for story related changes, or updates, as I am not as big an expert as the other fans, but I can make some&nbsp;<span>recommendations to make the document easier to read.</span></span></p><p><span>1) Have you thought of using the flowchart option? You can make it have different paths, colors, and styles to represent timelines, and parallel stories</span></p><p><span>2) Add a legend to show what the colors represent</span></p><p><span>3) Have you considered \"prettying\" it&nbsp;up with nemesis icons, and text? </span></p><p><span>Here are some questions about the timeline</span></p><p><span>1) Have there been any battles that the heroes lost? Are they there?</span></p><p><span>Overall, I love this. It's really neat, and I can't wait to try it on my own!</span></p><p><span>If you need help with anything, keep me posted, and I can help spruce up the document if you want!</span></p>",
