        "raw": "[quote=\"cnranger\"]\n\nIf its anything like comics they probably lose in the first few meetings with the villain before rallying and winning in the end. What would you consider a hero loss?\n\n[/quote]\n\nLike, the heroes fail at stopping an event, and a new team comes in, or heroes die. Knowing lots about comics, the heroes also tend to win &quot;in the end&quot;.\n\nI was just curious if those battles were docemented. If not, then no need to add them! I don&#39;t want to derail this thread from XtremeGuardian&#39;s awesome project.&nbsp; I wouldn&#39;t mind having another thread about &quot;losses&quot; unless it came help out the document. \n\n Sorry to cut it short. \n\n&nbsp;\n",
