        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/x/278dde/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-20T02:55:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"UXM266\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/48/1966_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> UXM266:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<ol>\n<li>Have you thought of using the flowchart option? You can make it have different paths, colors, and styles to represent timelines, and parallel stories2) Add a legend to show what the colors represent3) Have you considered “prettying” it up with nemesis icons, and text?</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Thanks for the ideas and the offers to help. I will need to look into the flow chart option and including the icons would make it look awesome.</p>\n<p>Once I outline some more of the story, I would love some help with the presentation!</p>",
